      "writtenOn": "2014-10-22T09:30:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have to think about it some more, but I\u0027m not sure if filtering by group_id makes sense in effective mode - basically groups should be expanded before any filtering (hence filtering by user makes sense, but not group).  I don\u0027t think the old code would work if you tried that.  Have a think about it, but we might be able to simplify this a bit.",
      "revId": "cad67e293005f73713e20a42b81b7112294d2bd6",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
