        "filename": "keystone/assignment/controllers.py",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 966,
      "author": {
        "id": 11022
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-10-24T14:07:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When I think effective + group, I imagine the request returning all users in a group and their respective roles (group roles).\n\nI would return both group and user role, if we are querying user + effective.\n\nAlthough the 1) point makes sense to me. Effective will never follow any REST API-like behaviour, another example would be querying for domain + effective in an env with OS-INHERIT active.",
      "parentUuid": "9aa7fdbe_f57aac22",
      "revId": "cad67e293005f73713e20a42b81b7112294d2bd6",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
