      "writtenOn": "2014-10-22T09:30:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If inherited is False, the the above call will return all assignments, included the inherited ones (see my comment in sql.py).  I think that means that the subsequent formatting will include inherited assignments in the result if the OS-INHERIT extension is enabled.  I don\u0027t think this is what we want.\n\nI don\u0027t believe the fix is to change _filter_inherited(), rather it is to fix assignment_api.list_role_assigments() to correctly honour the inherited flag.",
      "revId": "cad67e293005f73713e20a42b81b7112294d2bd6",
